, 27 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"ascension-reza-2019-02-27-e1","era":null,"summary":"Tagan urges Reza to visit the Historical Archives in person to follow up with a new law, and he agrees despite his fear of flying.","participants":["tagan","reza"],"location":"old-laws-library","importance":"minor","page":"stories/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","order":683,"story_date":"2019-02-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":24,"quote":"You should visit the Historical Archives yourself, while your rune is still new in the sky.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=You%20should%20visit%20the,new%20in%20the%20sky.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Ascension of Reza","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=You%20should%20visit%20the,new%20in%20the%20sky.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Ascension of Reza\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"ascension-reza-2019-02-27-e2","era":null,"summary":"Reza flies a griffin over Ravnica, passing his own law rune in the sky, and then is thrown when lightning shoots a thopter.","participants":["reza"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","order":683,"story_date":"2019-02-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":39,"quote":"I try to compensate so I can steady it, but my efforts make things worse, and I lose my grip.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=I%20try%20to%20compensate,I%20lose%20my%20grip.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Ascension of Reza","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=I%20try%20to%20compensate,I%20lose%20my%20grip.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Ascension of Reza\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"ascension-reza-2019-02-27-e3","era":null,"summary":"Reza falls into a pile of trash in the Thinktank and is helped by Hendrik, who explains a mad genius has been shooting down thopters.","participants":["reza","hendrik-azmerak","thinktank"],"location":"thinktank","importance":"major","page":"stories/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","order":683,"story_date":"2019-02-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":45,"quote":"That was a mighty fall you took. You're lucky to be alive.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=That%20was%20a%20mighty,lucky%20to%20be%20alive.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Ascension of Reza","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=That%20was%20a%20mighty,lucky%20to%20be%20alive.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Ascension of Reza\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"ascension-reza-2019-02-27-e4","era":null,"summary":"Reza follows Hendrik home and meets Janin, who cleans his robes and offers vedalken cleansing oils.","participants":["reza","hendrik-azmerak","janin"],"location":"thinktank","importance":"minor","page":"stories/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","order":683,"story_date":"2019-02-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":63,"quote":"I'm Janin. I keep the gears from falling off in this little hovel.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=I%27m%20Janin.%20I%20keep,in%20this%20little%20hovel.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Ascension of Reza","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=I%27m%20Janin.%20I%20keep,in%20this%20little%20hovel.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Ascension of Reza\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"ascension-reza-2019-02-27-e5","era":null,"summary":"A vedalken mugger steals one of Reza's satchels, and when Reza seeks help at the edge of the Thinktank, Azorius arresters suspect him instead.","participants":["reza","azorius-senate"],"location":"thinktank","importance":"minor","page":"stories/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","order":683,"story_date":"2019-02-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":85,"quote":"He swipes at the strap of one of my satchels. It comes free, and then he's running off with my precious reference texts.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=He%20swipes%20at%20the,my%20precious%20reference%20texts.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Ascension of Reza","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=He%20swipes%20at%20the,my%20precious%20reference%20texts.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Ascension of Reza\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"ascension-reza-2019-02-27-e6","era":null,"summary":"Missing his identity rune, Reza throws a vial of cleansing oil at the arresters and flees, fearing arrest under his own new law.","participants":["reza","azorius-senate"],"location":"thinktank","importance":"major","page":"stories/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","order":683,"story_date":"2019-02-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":100,"quote":"I retrieve it from the satchel, then throw it down at the arrester's feet.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=I%20retrieve%20it%20from,at%20the%20arrester%27s%20feet.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Ascension of Reza","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=I%20retrieve%20it%20from,at%20the%20arrester%27s%20feet.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Ascension of Reza\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"ascension-reza-2019-02-27-e7","era":null,"summary":"Hendrik and Janin rescue Reza in a thopter vehicle assembled from stolen Azorius parts, and Reza realizes Hendrik is the thopter shooter.","participants":["hendrik-azmerak","janin","reza"],"location":"thinktank","importance":"minor","page":"stories/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","order":683,"story_date":"2019-02-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":103,"quote":"You're the 'mad genius' who's been shooting down thopters!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=You%27re%20the%20%27mad%20genius%27,been%20shooting%20down%20thopters%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Ascension of Reza","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=You%27re%20the%20%27mad%20genius%27,been%20shooting%20down%20thopters%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Ascension of Reza\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"ascension-reza-2019-02-27-e9","era":null,"summary":"Reza invokes emergency law to name Hendrik Grand Arbiter pro tem and grants the Thinktank sovereignty so it can request Azorius help.","participants":["reza","hendrik-azmerak","janin","thinktank"],"location":"thinktank","importance":"major","page":"stories/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","order":683,"story_date":"2019-02-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":130,"quote":"By the prerogative writ of emergency, and by a unanimous vote, I hereby declare Hendrik Azmerak Grand Arbiter pro tem of the Thinktank Enclave.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=By%20the%20prerogative%20writ,of%20the%20Thinktank%20Enclave.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Ascension of Reza","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-27","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/ascension-reza-2019-02-27#:~:text=By%20the%20prerogative%20writ,of%20the%20Thinktank%20Enclave.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Ascension of Reza\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 27 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"ascension-reza-2019-02-27-e10","era":null,"summary":"Azorius archons and nullmages subdue the elemental after Reza's law rune brings help.","participants":["azorius-senate","thinktank-electrical-elemental","reza"],"location":"thinktank","importance":"major","page":"stories/ascension-reza-2019-02-27","order":683,"story_date":"2019-02-27","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":132,"quote":"They work t